<!-- 识别任务列表页：正在识别 + 识别历史；任务卡片支持左滑删除（入库中仅提示） -->
<view class="page task-list">
  <view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="empty"><text class="empty-icon">⏳</text><view>加载中…</view></view>

  <block wx:else>
    <view class="section-title">正在识别</view>
    <view wx:if="{{running.length}}" class="task-group">
      <!-- 左滑容器：内容层可位移露出右侧操作区（删除/正在入库中） -->
      <view wx:for="{{running}}" wx:key="taskId" class="swipe-wrap">
        <!-- 右侧操作区：入库中显示提示，其余显示删除按钮 -->
        <view class="swipe-actions">
          <view wx:if="{{item.swipeRunning}}" class="swipe-tip">正在入库中</view>
          <view wx:else class="swipe-del" data-id="{{item.taskId}}" catchtap="onDeleteTask">删除</view>
        </view>
        <!-- 内容层：跟随左滑位移；点击进详情 -->
        <view
          class="card task-card swipe-content {{openedTaskId === item.taskId ? 'swipe-open' : ''}}"
          data-id="{{item.taskId}}"
          bindtap="openTask"
          bindtouchstart="onTaskTouchStart"
          bindtouchend="onTaskTouchEnd"
          data-taskid="{{item.taskId}}"
          data-running="{{item.swipeRunning}}"
        >
          <view class="task-card-head">
            <text class="task-batch">🕐 {{item.batchName}}</text>
            <text class="task-status task-status-running">{{item.statusText}}</text>
          </view>
          <view class="muted">进度 {{item.progressText}} · {{item.timeText}}</view>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view wx:else class="empty">
      <text class="empty-icon">🌱</text>
      <view>暂无识别任务</view>
    </view>

    <view class="section-title">识别历史</view>
    <view wx:if="{{history.length}}" class="task-group">
      <view wx:for="{{history}}" wx:key="taskId" class="swipe-wrap">
        <view class="swipe-actions">
          <view wx:if="{{item.swipeRunning}}" class="swipe-tip">正在入库中</view>
          <view wx:else class="swipe-del" data-id="{{item.taskId}}" catchtap="onDeleteTask">删除</view>
        </view>
        <view
          class="card task-card swipe-content {{openedTaskId === item.taskId ? 'swipe-open' : ''}}"
          data-id="{{item.taskId}}"
          bindtap="openTask"
          bindtouchstart="onTaskTouchStart"
          bindtouchend="onTaskTouchEnd"
          data-taskid="{{item.taskId}}"
          data-running="{{item.swipeRunning}}"
        >
          <view class="task-card-head">
            <text class="task-batch">🕐 {{item.batchName}}</text>
            <text class="task-status">{{item.statusText}}</text>
          </view>
          <view class="muted">结果 {{item.progressText}} · {{item.timeText}}</view>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view wx:else class="empty">
      <text class="empty-icon">🗂</text>
      <view>暂无识别历史</view>
    </view>
  </block>
</view>
